meta {
  name: List My Shifts
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{coreBaseUrl}}:8113/
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{idToken}}
}

docs {
  functions-core: ListMyShifts (port 8113). Nursery gets shifts it posted
  (any status); staff get shifts booked to them — determined server-side
  from the caller's own profile role. Plain-HTTP mirror of a query that's
  already client-legal per Security Rules (§3), added because the frontend
  moved off the Firestore client SDK — see root README.md.
}
